WEBVTT

00:00:00.579 --> 00:00:02.266
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Do I need</b> a ticket?

00:00:06.291 --> 00:00:07.578
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, <b>you do</b>.

00:00:09.588 --> 00:00:10.892
No, <b>you don’t</b>.

00:00:13.906 --> 00:00:15.642
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Do you live</b> near here?

00:00:19.683 --> 00:00:21.123
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, <b>I do</b>.

00:00:23.147 --> 00:00:24.713
No, <b>I don’t</b>.

00:00:27.791 --> 00:00:29.387
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Do we have</b> good seats?

00:00:33.458 --> 00:00:34.991
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, <b>we do</b>.

00:00:37.055 --> 00:00:38.675
No, <b>we don’t</b>.

00:00:41.719 --> 00:00:43.387
<v><b>A:</b></v> <b>Do they like</b> children?

00:00:47.410 --> 00:00:49.028
<v><b>B:</b></v> Yes, <b>they do</b>.

00:00:51.060 --> 00:00:52.845
No, <b>they don’t</b>.